    "en": {
      "name": "Susukino",
      "description": "Susukino (すすきの) is a district in Chūō-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaidō, Japan known for entertainment and nightlife. The district contains many restaurants, bars, hotels, and adult-entertainment establishments. The name Susukino is often written as 薄野 in kanji and ススキノ in katakana, and directly translates as \"zebra grass field\".",
      "highlights": ["Culture"]
    },
    "ja": {
      "name": "すすきの",
      "description": "すすきの（ススキノ、薄野、英: Susukino）は、北海道札幌市中央区にある、すすきの交差点を中心とした歓楽街・繁華街。札幌駅周辺や大通地区とともに札幌の中心市街地を構成している。日本国内外から観光客が訪れる観光地にもなっている。",
      "highlights": ["展望"]
    }
  },
